  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3ff6acaa8b9f1994499dd387e6188532, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Comments: This scene demonstrates the use of an AudioTrack component to add a soundtrack
    synchronized to Timeflow. Typically, 1 audio track is used per scene and configured
    to sync with Timeflow. Additional tracks may be added, however only 1 track may
    be used to synchronize the scene.
  Warning: Please note that audio playback is handled entirely by Unity and Timeflow
    is only providing the base timing. For more advanced audio setups you may want
    to use audio mixers.
  URLTitle: Audio Track Documentation
  URL: https://axongenesis.gitbook.io/timeflow/reference/behaviors/audio/audio-track
  URL2Title: Audio Mixer Documentation
  URL2: https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/AudioMixer.html
